{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And I will bless you before YHWH.</b> This means: by the word of HaShem — that upon every blessing with which your father the Holy One, blessed be He, blesses you, He will concur through him; therefore I command you to pursue them. A similar interpretation was given in the portion of Noah regarding Nimrod." "<b>And I will bless you.</b> With kaf and he. [In a word with a bet.]"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:12.983853272Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}